\\\\ {e}^{y} & =\\frac{{e}^{4x}}{4}+C\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying the natural logarithm to both sides, we find the general solution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{ln}⁡({e}^{y}) & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{{e}^{4x}}{4}+C) \\\\ y & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{{e}^{4x}}{4}+C)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now apply the condition $y(0)=5$ to find $C:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(0) & =5 \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{{e}^{4\\cdot 0}}{4}+C) & =5 \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{1}{4}+C) & =5 \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}+C & ={e}^{5} \\\\ C & =\\frac{4{e}^{5}-1}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus the particular solution of $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{4x-y}$ that satisfies the condition $y(0)=5$ is\n\n$$\ny=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{{e}^{4x}+4{e}^{5}-1}{4}).\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14050314/state.json" "file_sha256" "1b083dbb847d3dfedf79fae411e6ca44f425417ff0dc1da3948e334a7aa2398e"} {"question" "q-20071" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14050314/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "ba6835924838d81122aa90d9a5c26b5dec67f7b1a06cd80083dbfbf39543c9c6"} {"question" "q-20071" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14050314/state.json" "file_sha256" "1b083dbb847d3dfedf79fae411e6ca44f425417ff0dc1da3948e334a7aa2398e"} {"question" "q-20071" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{{e}^{4x}+4{e}^{5}-1}{4})"] ["math" "y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{{e}^{4x}}{4}+C)"] ["math" "y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{{e}^{4x}}{4}+{e}^{5}+\\frac{1}{4})"] ["math" "y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(